        "content": {
            "rendered": "\n<section class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-container hero is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-gradient top hero is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-gradient middle hero is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-stack hero is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading hero title\">Helping teams build with autonomy and AI.<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"hero subtitle\">I\u2019m Spencer Pope \u2014 an independent technologist specializing in<br>full-stack and DevOps consulting for lean teams who want to move<br>faster, smarter, and with less friction.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons buttons hero is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button hero cta contained\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/consulting\">Work with me<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline hero cta outlined is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/about\">Learn more<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"hero final-words\">Based in Shanghai. Working remotely worldwide.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-gradient bottom hero is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-container is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-stack is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Build. Automate. Simplify.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>I help small teams and founders ship faster by removing technical roadblocks and strengthening their systems. Whether it\u2019s a production-ready app or a cleaner CI\/CD pipeline, I bring a hands-on approach and an eye for efficiency.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Full-Stack Development<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>React, Node.js, PHP, WordPress \u2014 I build, refactor, and document clean, maintainable codebases.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">DevOps &amp; Infrastructure<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>From Docker and AWS to CI\/CD and database tuning, I make environments stable, secure, and scalable.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Technical Strategy<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>System audits, documentation, and AI-assisted workflows that make teams more autonomous.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-container is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-stack is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recent Projects<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>A few highlights from projects I\u2019ve built or supported in the past year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"310\" src=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/timberline-1024x310.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-566\" srcset=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/timberline-1024x310.png 1024w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/timberline-300x91.png 300w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/timberline-768x232.png 768w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/timberline.png 1313w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Timberline Instruments<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>An innovative scientific instrument manufacturer using <a href=\"\/forged-seo\">ForgedSEO<\/a> to build Google Search authority<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Drums for Schools<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>WooCommerce DevOps Support<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wordpress-automation-that-actually-works\">Learn more<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"677\" src=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-11.08.06\u202fPM-e1763306607919-1024x677.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-431\" srcset=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-11.08.06\u202fPM-e1763306607919-1024x677.png 1024w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-11.08.06\u202fPM-e1763306607919-300x198.png 300w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-11.08.06\u202fPM-e1763306607919-768x508.png 768w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-11.08.06\u202fPM-e1763306607919-1536x1016.png 1536w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-11.08.06\u202fPM-e1763306607919-2048x1355.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"254\" src=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-23-at-12.39.26\u202fPM-1024x254.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-496\" srcset=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-23-at-12.39.26\u202fPM-1024x254.png 1024w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-23-at-12.39.26\u202fPM-300x75.png 300w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-23-at-12.39.26\u202fPM-768x191.png 768w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-23-at-12.39.26\u202fPM-1536x382.png 1536w, https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Screenshot-2025-11-23-at-12.39.26\u202fPM.png 1642w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Deal Distribution tool<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Self-Hosted Operations for Private Equity<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/building-a-deal-distribution-automation-system-from-manual-chaos-to-one-click-campaigns\/\">Learn more<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-container is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-stack is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">My approach<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>I work best with small, independent teams who value autonomy and clarity. My process starts with understanding what you\u2019re trying to accomplish \u2014 then designing a lightweight, scalable solution that makes sense for your tools and people.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Communicate clearly, asynchronously when possible<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Document everything for future maintainers<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Automate repetitive tasks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use AI to accelerate learning and operations<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-container is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-stack is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Writing &amp; ideas<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>I write about software, systems, and the habits that make work sustainable.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed is-provider-wp-spenpo wp-block-embed-wp-spenpo\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-embedded-content\" data-secret=\"vrb9UJz2RR\"><a href=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/building-a-deal-distribution-automation-system-from-manual-chaos-to-one-click-campaigns\/\">Building a Deal Distribution Automation System: From Manual Chaos to One-Click Campaigns<\/a><\/blockquote><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"wp-embedded-content\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" security=\"restricted\" style=\"position: absolute; visibility: hidden;\" title=\"&#8220;Building a Deal Distribution Automation System: From Manual Chaos to One-Click Campaigns&#8221; &#8212; wp.spenpo\" src=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/building-a-deal-distribution-automation-system-from-manual-chaos-to-one-click-campaigns\/embed\/#?secret=a7qbF32mfT#?secret=vrb9UJz2RR\" data-secret=\"vrb9UJz2RR\" width=\"500\" height=\"282\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed is-provider-wp-spenpo wp-block-embed-wp-spenpo\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-embedded-content\" data-secret=\"S0k1uLlAVt\"><a href=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wordpress-automation-that-actually-works\/\">WordPress Automation that Actually Works<\/a><\/blockquote><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"wp-embedded-content\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" security=\"restricted\" style=\"position: absolute; visibility: hidden;\" title=\"&#8220;WordPress Automation that Actually Works&#8221; &#8212; wp.spenpo\" src=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/wordpress-automation-that-actually-works\/embed\/#?secret=ImrcTLwJ91#?secret=S0k1uLlAVt\" data-secret=\"S0k1uLlAVt\" width=\"500\" height=\"282\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-wp-embed is-provider-wp-spenpo wp-block-embed-wp-spenpo\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-embedded-content\" data-secret=\"fcfrWBSz0h\"><a href=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/what-i-learned-leading-a-startup-dev-team\/\">What I Learned Leading a Startup Dev Team<\/a><\/blockquote><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"wp-embedded-content\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" security=\"restricted\" style=\"position: absolute; visibility: hidden;\" title=\"&#8220;What I Learned Leading a Startup Dev Team&#8221; &#8212; wp.spenpo\" src=\"https:\/\/wp.spenpo.com\/what-i-learned-leading-a-startup-dev-team\/embed\/#?secret=FVoS0cDhdW#?secret=fcfrWBSz0h\" data-secret=\"fcfrWBSz0h\" width=\"500\" height=\"282\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-container call-to-action is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group spenpo-stack is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Let\u2019s Build Something Together<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Whether you need help deploying a feature, cleaning up a server, or planning a technical roadmap \u2014 I can jump in and help. I work on short-term projects, retainers, and collaborations with founders and small teams.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/consulting\">Start a conversation<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>No sales talk \u2014 just a real conversation about your goals and where I can help.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n",
